// Heavy attack: 50 ticks, the default heavy attack (docs/architecture.md
// section 11, "模型和动画"): startup 0-22, active 22-27, recovery 27-50.
// Each part has keyframes at its ends, so the game can stretch each part
// on its own.
// Rotations are YXZ degrees about each bone's position along the model's
// axes (+X right, +Y up, -Z forward); see assets/anims/README.md for which
// way each bone turns.
//
// Both hands on the grip (the left hand from tick 10 to 35). Tick 0:
// standing. 10: lifting the sword. 18 to 22: holding it up behind the
// right shoulder, leaning back, gathering. 22 to 27: the blow, one key
// a tick, from high on the right down to low on the left (right to
// left, as the hit sweeps), lunging onto the left foot. 35: still low,
// the long recovery. 43: coming back. 50: standing.
// Tip heights (m) in the active part, by tick: 22: 2.19, 23: 1.87, 24: 1.49, 25: 1.03, 26: 0.50, 27: 0.44.
